#: .\templates\about.html:12
msgid ""
"AURA Group - 2025-yil 1-iyulda tashkil etilgan, bizneslar uchun ishonchli va "
"natijador IT hamkor."
msgstr ""
"AURA Group is a reliable and results-driven IT partner, founded on July 1, "
"2025."

#: .\templates\about.html:22
msgid "Bizning hikoyamiz"
msgstr "Our Story"

#: .\templates\about.html:23
msgid "Texnologiya va innovatsiya bilan kelajakni bunyod etamiz"
msgstr "Building the future with technology and innovation"

#: .\templates\about.html:25
msgid ""
"AURA Group 2025-yil 1-iyulda Boborahim Rustamqulov rahbarligida tashkil "
"etilgan. Kompaniya qisqa muddat ichida bizneslar uchun zamonaviy IT "
"xizmatlarni taqdim etuvchi ishonchli jamoaga aylandi."
msgstr ""
"AURA Group was founded on July 1, 2025 under the leadership of Boborahim "
"Rustamqulov. In a short period, the company became a trusted team delivering "
"modern IT services for businesses."

#: .\templates\about.html:28
msgid ""
"Kompaniyamiz falsafasi O'zbekiston IT bozorida xalqaro standartlarga javob "
"beradigan kuchli jamoani shakllantirishga asoslanadi."
msgstr ""
"Our company philosophy is built on forming a strong team in Uzbekistan's IT "
"market that meets international standards."

#: .\templates\about.html:31
msgid ""
"Biz yosh dasturchilar uchun o'sish va rasmiy ishga joylashish imkoniyatini "
"yaratamiz, bizneslar IT infratuzilmasini rivojlantiramiz va AURA Group'ni IT "
"jahon sahnasida tanilgan kompaniyaga aylantirishni maqsad qilganmiz."
msgstr ""
"We create growth and formal employment opportunities for young developers, "
"strengthen IT infrastructure for businesses, and aim to make AURA Group a "
"recognized company on the global IT stage."

