#: .\templates\about.html:65
msgid ""
"AURA Group missiyasi sifatli xizmatlar va ilg'or IT yechimlar orqali "
"bizneslarga barqaror o'sish berish, O'zbekiston kompaniyalarining IT "
"infratuzilmasini kuchaytirish hamda yosh mutaxassislar uchun real ish "
"imkoniyatlarini kengaytirishdir."
msgstr ""
"AURA Group's mission is to deliver sustainable growth to businesses through "
"quality services and advanced IT solutions, strengthen the IT infrastructure "
"of Uzbek companies, and expand real job opportunities for young "
"professionals."

